Profession Heaven [PROF] was a guild whose territory was held by treaty rather than by force.

## History

### Neutrality (2021)

Profession Heaven was created on 20 January 2021 by [[crokee|Crokee]],{{cite:api-wynncraft-com-v3-guild-profession-20heaven|creation date, retrieved 2 Sep 2026}} who ran it as chief, as a public profession-XP guild.{{cite:thread-285237|post #1, opened 9 Feb 2021}} Five days later, on 25 January 2021, it was granted neutral status - protected by both [[Goose]] and [[Artemis]], the two warring blocs of the day - and given territory in the Silent Expanse.{{cite:chronicle-records|Chronicle alliance and event records}} Its first territory exchange came the same day.{{cite:territory-exchanges|territory_exchanges map-data analysis}} Who brokered the arrangement was never recorded.{{cite:chronicle-records|Chronicle alliance and event records}}

Crokee codified the guild's posture as internal law in its forum thread of 9 February 2021, whose rules include 'Keep the guild as neutral as possible towards all other guilds. No bias towards any guild.' The guild's stated goal was 'to be able to provide territory GXP boost to Dernic professions to any player who needs it', with open temporary membership for any player who wanted the boost.{{cite:thread-285237|post #1, opened 9 Feb 2021}} The arrangement survived [[the-great-collapse|the Great Collapse]] of May 2021 and the successor blocs that followed.

### Inside the super-alliances (2022-2023)

Profession Heaven was one of the fourteen guilds of [[Cucumber Company]] on the last public alliance roster ever posted to [[the-forum-megalist|the forum megalist]], on 26 June 2022,{{cite:thread-278112-p08|p8 #160, 26 Jun 2022}} and carried through the renames into [[smtn elf]], remaining until that alliance's quiet dissolution in mid-2023.{{cite:chronicle-records|Chronicle alliance and event records}} Through the wars of [[private-diplomacy-era|the private-diplomacy era]] that followed, its land went largely unmolested.{{cite:territory-exchanges|territory_exchanges map-data analysis}}

### The fall of neutrality (2026)

On 25 May 2026 KongoBoys - a former Cucumber Company and smtn elf ally - began [[fall-of-profession-heaven-s-neutrality|a sustained campaign against Profession Heaven]], running as high as 1,700 territory exchanges a week and ending five years of neutrality.{{cite:territory-exchanges|territory_exchanges map-data analysis}}{{cite:chronicle-records|Chronicle alliance and event records}} The campaign was still ongoing as of September 2026.

