**UltimateXeons** [UXs] is a Wynncraft guild created on 7 February 2015{{cite:api-wynncraft-com-v3-guild-ultimatexeons|creation date 7 Feb 2015, retrieved 3 Sep 2026}}, matching the date its recruitment thread carries — "Established on Feb 7th, 2015" — though the same thread's prose says only "established by me alone on Feb 2015", and its owner told the thread in February 2016 "yea, its been since 2015 march i guess".{{cite:thread-109350|post #1, as last revised 30 Nov 2017}}{{cite:thread-109350|post #4, motoki1, 18 Feb 2016}} It was a first-rank territorial power in 2016 and is the guild whose thread preserves the only roster of [[ordo-malleus|Ordo Malleus]]. Its owner throughout was motoki1, who is a different person from [[motoki317]], the author of the moto-bot utility bot.{{cite:api-wynncraft-com-v3-guild-ultimatexeons|owner field, retrieved 3 Sep 2026}}

## History

The recruitment thread was opened on 2 February 2016.{{cite:thread-109350|post #2, Paladin A'renos, 2 Feb 2016}} On 20 February motoki1 posted "Update: Joined the Alliance Ordo Malleus!"{{cite:thread-109350|post #7, 20 Feb 2016}}, and [[drew1011|Drew1011]] quoted the opening post in full the same day — preserving the alliance section, its single rule "Don't attack the territories that ally guilds own", and the twelve-guild roster that is Ordo Malleus' only recorded membership list.{{cite:thread-109350|post #11, Drew1011, 20 Feb 2016, quoting the opening post}} Drew1011 asked motoki1 for his Skype "so you can be added to the Ordo Malleus skype chats".{{cite:thread-109350|post #11, Drew1011, 20 Feb 2016}} The guild's own rules carried the same principle in its own words: "Don't attack allies' territories when you do wars."{{cite:thread-109350|post #1, as last revised 30 Nov 2017}}

After Ordo Malleus fell, UltimateXeons was a party to the land pact around [[hackforums|HackForums]]. "Our alliance with Hax and Lir (we are UXs) is gonna let the three guilds keep their territory (we are like the only three guilds with any real territory) without anybody really taking it unless one of the guilds leaves or breaks the alliance", a member wrote on 27 June 2016{{cite:thread-133666|post #13, valvoid, 27 Jun 2016}}; another put the balance more plainly — "UXs has about the same amount of territories as Libertas... Lir and Hax aren't the only ones to watch out for"{{cite:thread-133666|posts #17 and #19, WhettoWen, 28 Jun 2016}} — and, on an anti-Hax thread a fortnight earlier, described the arrangement's daily effect: "Although I do find it a bit annoying to go from Detlas to Ragni and have every single territory owned by Hax, My guild is in a alliance with them."{{cite:thread-130386-p03|post #58, WhettoWen, 14 Jun 2016}} On 23 September 2016 UltimateXeons stood third on the map with 53 of roughly 332 territories, at guild level 52 with 58 members.{{cite:pre2018-territory-snapshots|pre2018-territory-snapshots.json — Wayback Machine capture of the Wynncraft v1 API guild leaderboard, 23 Sep 2016}} Three weeks later an applicant to [[libertas|Libertas]] dismissed it in passing as one of "two shitty guilds that are dead ( Snr and UXs )" — a characterisation at odds with the leaderboard of three weeks earlier.{{cite:thread-119596-p16|post #316, 10 Oct 2016}}

In September 2016 motoki1 was among the five founders of the [[lux-imperius|Lux Imperius]] community alliance, in which UltimateXeons was described as "a Community Guild (Also Semi-War)".{{cite:thread-153722|post #1, opened 16 Sep 2016, last revised 25 Oct 2016}} The guild was still being named among the map's Hax-aligned holders in March 2017, when a defender of Hax asked its critics "are Lir, BLA, UXs somehow exempt?"{{cite:thread-179383|post #7, 1 Mar 2017}} It then joined the [[emperium-of-wynn|Emperium of Wynn]], where it appears with motoki1 as its owner in rosters of May and August 2017.{{cite:thread-188024|post #4, Yuno F Gasai, 7 May 2017}}{{cite:thread-188024|post #1, member-guild roster, as revised Aug 2017}}

By 30 November 2017 the guild was ranked fifth at level 61 with 28 of 65 places filled, recruiting by invitation only "until the glitches get fixed, at least", and had emptied both of its thread's alliance sections — "War Allies... None at the moment!" and "Alliances... None at the moment!" — with [[lux-imperius|Lux Imperius]] moved to a collapsed "Old alliances" list. motoki1 added a note at the top: "This thread is pretty much outdated, so please contact me directly if you want to ask about anything listed here."{{cite:thread-109350|post #1, as last revised 30 Nov 2017}} No alliance membership was recorded for the guild from January 2018 onward.{{cite:chronicle-records|Chronicle alliance and event records}} As of September 2026 UltimateXeons stands at guild level 67 with 27 members, no territories, and motoki1 still its owner.{{cite:api-wynncraft-com-v3-guild-ultimatexeons|level, members, territories and owner, retrieved 3 Sep 2026}}

