## History

### Founding
On 11 May 2021, in [[the-great-collapse|The Great Collapse]], [[Goose]] and [[Artemis]] dissolved on the same day. Thirteen guilds — drawn from Goose's broad membership together with Artemis alumni such as [[Titans Valor]] — formed Valhalla, with Guardian of Wynn joining immediately after the founding.{{cite:community-guild-timeline}} A megalist post of 25 May 2021 reported the reorganization: “the two major alliances both disbanded and got new names… Valhalla and Kaos”.{{cite:thread-278112-p07|post #136, Dream, 25 May 2021}} No public roster was ever posted — the megalist's alliance rosters lived in a Google Sheet that does not survive.{{cite:community-guild-timeline}} Valhalla is the first alliance membership recorded for [[The Aquarium]].{{cite:chronicle-records|Chronicle alliance and event records}}

### Dominance
Valhalla took map control from Goose's remnants in mid-May 2021 and dominated for the rest of the year while fighting the [[valhalla-khaos-war|Valhalla-Khaos war]].{{cite:community-guild-timeline}} A forum post of 25 September 2021 summed up its standing: “the meta of being top 10 on the guild sr leaderboard is to join valhalla”.{{cite:thread-295680|post #1, IamFye, 25 Sep 2021}}

### Betrayal and reorganization
Friction with two members, The Mage Legacy and TheNoLifes, appears to have begun in August 2021. Both turned openly on their allies — December 2021 saw 5,359 territory exchanges as the fighting erupted{{cite:territory-exchanges|territory_exchanges map-data analysis}} — and when ten Valhalla guilds reorganized as [[Vanir]] on 28 November 2021, both were excluded.{{cite:community-guild-timeline}} TheNoLifes went on to help lead [[Khaos]].{{cite:cameron-oral-history|oral-history testimony (Cameron, TAq veteran)}} No formal Valhalla dissolution was ever recorded; Vanir's founding marks its end.{{cite:chronicle-records|Chronicle alliance and event records}}

