## Legacy
Valkyrie outlived every war alliance of its time — [[Coalition]], [[the-federation|Federation]], [[Luna]], [[Terra]], [[Artemis]], [[Valhalla]] — spanning seven years and every era of guild warfare from 2015 to 2022.{{cite:chronicle-records|Chronicle alliance and event records}} Though it held territory in the interregnum, in each of its own self-descriptions across seven years it was a community alliance first.{{cite:thread-89529|post #1, opening post (thread opened 10 Sep 2015)}} Its constitutional formula — internal affairs to the guilds, foreign affairs to a unanimous council of guild masters — was reused almost verbatim by [[halcyon|Halcyon]] in 2016{{cite:thread-130444|post #1, opening post (Halcyon founded 5 Jun 2016 between ToastedPandas and Holders of LE)}} and was the earliest written model of alliance governance. Drew1011, describing Halcyon's founding, put the borrowing plainly: it was "a small two-guild alliance that totally wasn't a rip off of the original Valkyrie."{{cite:drew1011-storytime|L496, composed 26 Feb 2018}}

## History
On 28 November 2021 ten [[Valhalla]] guilds — including [[The Aquarium]] — reorganized as Vanir. Guardian of Wynn and Nefarious Ravens were invited on 1 December.{{cite:community-guild-timeline}} The reorganization doubled as a purge: The Mage Legacy and TheNoLifes, whose friction with the bloc had been building since August, were excluded, and their war on their former allies erupted that December — 5,359 territory exchanges in the month.{{cite:territory-exchanges|territory_exchanges map-data analysis}} Vanir inherited Valhalla's side of the ongoing [[valhalla-khaos-war|Valhalla-Khaos war]].{{cite:chronicle-records|Chronicle alliance and event records}}

The alliance did not survive the month. On 18 December 2021 [[Emorians]], Nefarious Ravens, IceBlue Team and [[Avicia]] left, and Vanir collapsed. [[Niflheim]], the community alliance overlapping much of its world, officially dissolved the same day.{{cite:community-guild-timeline}} The causes of the collapse were never publicly recorded.

