## Legacy
Vanir was the last alliance of the Valhalla line, and its twenty-day life marks the moment the era's mega-blocs stopped holding together. The winter that followed — [[Khaos]]'s last war against the ex-Vanir guilds — ended in the [[the-realignment-era|2022 realignment]] that produced [[Cucumber Company]], where most Vanir guilds reappeared alongside their former Khaos enemies.{{cite:chronicle-records|Chronicle alliance and event records}}

**yosteric5** owned [[libertas|Libertas]] [Lir], the second-largest territory holder on the Wynncraft map in 2016.

## Holders of LE (2015)

Before Libertas he ran Holders of LE on behalf of its absent owner SSEEBBYZ. In a 2015 forum post the guild's member Kuroi described him as "the stand-in leader of HoL, our guild" while petitioning Spham, the leader of Kangronomicon, to persuade SSEEBBYZ "to kick him out of the guild or demote him"{{cite:drew1011-storytime|L24–26 and the accompanying screenshot of Kuroi's forum post, composed 22 Feb 2018}}. [[drew1011|Drew1011]] — named in the post as one of the members behind it — was a party to the dispute.

![The 2015 forum post by Kuroi asking Kangronomicon's leader to intervene against yosteric5's leadership of Holders of LE, reproduced in Drew1011's account.](/images/chronicles/storytime/02-a64d84b0a8360b896c510f3abac7132c.webp)

By Drew1011's account the approach failed and the members involved instead raised their grievances with yosteric5 directly, who made two of them Head Chiefs{{cite:drew1011-storytime|L28–30, composed 22 Feb 2018}}; that later he demoted Drew1011 from co-leader to recruit on learning of the plot, and then removed him from the guild{{cite:drew1011-storytime|L43–46, composed 22 Feb 2018}}; that the two reconciled and Drew1011 rejoined as co-leader on 13 September 2015{{cite:drew1011-storytime|L55, composed 22 Feb 2018}}; and that on 22 September 2015 SSEEBBYZ sold the guild, after which yosteric5 was demoted and left, taking a number of members with him first to Validus and later to Libertas{{cite:drew1011-storytime|L67–76, composed 22 Feb 2018}}. yosteric5's own version of the quarrel was never recorded.

## Libertas (2016–17)

The guild's recruitment thread, which he opened on 30 March 2016 and kept for eighteen months, gives its leadership as three people: himself as owner, Amplitude as co-owner and Master_NinjasHD as head chief{{cite:thread-119596|post #3, 30 Mar 2016}} He posted its progress as it climbed — "Libertas is now Ranked #15! we hit level 43 today! I would like to think my active war members for all there hard work"{{cite:thread-119596|post #8, 10 Apr 2016}} — and by the thread's last revision, on 6 November 2016, its header read "Guild Rank: 2 / Guild Level: 62".{{cite:thread-119596|post #1, as revised 6 Nov 2016}} In September 2016 Libertas held 60 of the map's roughly 332 territories, behind only [[hackforums|HackForums]].{{cite:pre2018-territory-snapshots|pre2018-territory-snapshots.json — Wayback Machine capture of the Wynncraft v1 API guild leaderboard, 23 Sep 2016}}

Libertas joined [[ordo-malleus|Ordo Malleus]] on 1 December 2015; Drew1011 says he sponsored the application after the two "made our amends"{{cite:drew1011-storytime|L245–246, composed 22 Feb 2018}}. It appears in the alliance's February 2016 roster{{cite:thread-109350|post #11, 20 Feb 2016}}. Drew1011 also asserted that Ezura of Validus "had given Yosteric the funds to create the guild"{{cite:drew1011-storytime|L247, composed 22 Feb 2018}}; how Libertas was funded was never otherwise recorded.

He was well connected across guild lines — "I do know that especially since I always talk to yost", a poster wrote in August 2016 when the [[hackforums|HackForums]] bloc came up{{cite:thread-143392|post #13, 9 Aug 2016}} — and his personal availability was read as a measure of the guild's strength: "Yosteric and Lir wont be too difficult, as their warring standards are usually based around yos being on", a rival wrote that October.{{cite:thread-153722-p03|post #49, 16 Oct 2016}}

One request went unanswered. On 9 August 2016 a Libertas member addressed him in the thread: "I just wanted to know the name of our alliance and if I can make a guild shop."{{cite:thread-119596-p08|post #152, 9 Aug 2016}} No reply appears in the thread's twenty-six pages, and no name for the bloc was ever recorded. He is listed as Libertas' owner in the [[emperium-of-wynn|Emperium of Wynn]] roster of May 2017{{cite:thread-188024|post #4, Yuno F Gasai, 7 May 2017}}, and his last recorded post, accepting two applicants, is dated 21 September 2017.{{cite:thread-119596-p26|post #516, 21 Sep 2017}}
